@prefix uni: <http://example.org/uni#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Classes
uni:Norm a rdfs:Class .
uni:Article a rdfs:Class .
uni:Clause a rdfs:Class .
uni:Version a rdfs:Class .
uni:Program a rdfs:Class .
uni:Cohort a rdfs:Class .
uni:TemporalScope a rdfs:Class .

# Object properties
uni:overrides a rdf:Property .
uni:cites a rdf:Property .
uni:appliesToProgram a rdf:Property .
uni:appliesToCohort a rdf:Property .
uni:hasExceptionFor a rdf:Property .

# Data properties
uni:effectiveFrom a rdf:Property .
uni:effectiveUntil a rdf:Property .
uni:minCredits a rdf:Property .
